"Search for helpdesk tickets (model_name: helpdesk.ticket), retrieve the most "
"recent 5 tickets and summarize what they complain about (field_name: "
"description).\n"
"Include the ticket name (field_name: name) in the response. Don't mention "
"model_name or field_name or any record ids in the response."
msgstr ""
"Recherchez les tickets d’assistance (model_name : helpdesk.ticket), "
"récupérez les 5 tickets les plus récents et résumez les problèmes signalés "
"dans leur description (field_name : description).\n"
"Incluez le nom du ticket (field_name : name) dans la réponse. Ne mentionnez "
"ni model_name, ni field_name, ni aucun identifiant d’enregistrement dans la "
"réponse."

